WEBVTT

00:03.550 --> 00:05.710
<b>I'm very sorry.</b>

00:07.670 --> 00:09.800
<b>Come on...</b>

00:09.930 --> 00:13.220
<b>I want you to really, really...</b>

00:13.760 --> 00:16.390
<b>think about what you've done.</b>

00:17.230 --> 00:18.020
<b>Yes, ma'am.</b>

00:18.140 --> 00:21.730
<b>Abducting another group's member
during an event?</b>

00:21.860 --> 00:24.270
<b>That's completely unheard of.</b>

00:24.650 --> 00:25.780
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:25.900 --> 00:27.440
<b>But still...</b>

00:27.650 --> 00:30.740
<b>If they hadn't dragged
a complete outsider</b>

00:30.860 --> 00:34.370
<b>up on stage,
this never would've happened.</b>

00:34.660 --> 00:37.500
<b>We can use that against them.</b>

00:42.250 --> 00:43.540
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

00:44.460 --> 00:45.630
<b>Are you all right?</b>

00:46.760 --> 00:49.510
<b>Yeah. I was just scolded.</b>

00:51.640 --> 00:56.430
<b>I was sure my life was over back then.</b>

00:57.850 --> 01:02.730
<b>And today, more than ever,
I really thought it was the end.</b>

01:03.860 --> 01:05.270
<b>But it wasn't.</b>

01:06.400 --> 01:09.490
<b>Manager-san said she'd fight for me.</b>

01:09.950 --> 01:13.410
<b>She told me to quickly
get back to my usual self.</b>

01:14.370 --> 01:20.500
<b>That means it's okay for me
to keep going, right?</b>

01:26.130 --> 01:27.880
<b>I'm only looking ahead.</b>

01:28.840 --> 01:32.800
<b>You got me out of there,
so there's no way I'm going back now.</b>

01:32.930 --> 01:34.180
<b>Ricchan.</b>

01:35.550 --> 01:36.510
<b>It'll be okay.</b>

01:37.510 --> 01:38.890
<b>I'm sure of it.</b>

01:55.200 --> 01:59.750
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

02:00.750 --> 02:05.540
<b><i>The story always revolves around us</i></b>

02:05.670 --> 02:10.170
<b><i>That may be a given But let me repeat it</i></b>

02:10.590 --> 02:15.590
<b><i>Can you read the guidelines?
No matter how carefully we write them</i></b>

02:15.760 --> 02:20.430
<b><i>Why does something always get in the way?
Still, we'll make it roar!</i></b>

02:20.720 --> 02:24.600
<b><i>In a heartbeat, like an overdrive</i></b>

02:24.730 --> 02:31.440
<b><i>We yearn to distort the world we see</i></b>

02:31.610 --> 02:36.280
<b><i>Seeing too clearly makes innocence
seem ridiculous, what a joke!</i></b>

02:36.450 --> 02:40.950
<b><i>Even vain attempts at being brave
Will be rewarded when the time comes</i></b>

02:41.120 --> 02:44.960
<b><i>This is the plot of our survival</i></b>

02:45.120 --> 02:50.710
<b><i>Rewriting the tale
Shedding absurd tears, the newtype way</i></b>

02:50.840 --> 02:55.260
<b><i>We can go anywhere, we can, so don't stop now</i></b>

02:55.590 --> 02:59.970
<b><i>Not an anime, not real either,
let's make our own category</i></b>

03:00.100 --> 03:03.230
<b><i>We've grown tired
of this complicated, dull world!</i></b>

03:03.350 --> 03:06.650
<b><i>Leave it to us, we'll write our own dreams</i></b>

03:06.770 --> 03:09.900
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype, our choice</i></b>

03:10.020 --> 03:11.650
<b><i>Following the steady beat</i></b>

03:11.780 --> 03:16.740
<b><i>Ready set and find out ready set and find out
it's only one newtype</i></b>

03:20.080 --> 03:23.080
<b>I'm really, really,</b>

03:23.250 --> 03:25.580
<b>really sorry!</b>

03:26.960 --> 03:30.040
<b>Whatever.
You just did what you wanted, right?</b>

03:30.170 --> 03:32.750
<b>Oh, I didn't mean it like that.</b>

03:33.420 --> 03:36.590
<b>Did I push her in the wrong direction?</b>

03:36.720 --> 03:41.680
<b>We're not streaming for a while,
so maybe you can relax a little.</b>

03:42.510 --> 03:43.810
<b>No, that's not it.</b>

03:44.680 --> 03:47.230
<b>It's only natural for you to be angry.</b>

03:47.350 --> 03:48.150
<b>I'm not...</b>

03:48.270 --> 03:50.020
<b>I'm truly sorry.</b>

03:50.150 --> 03:53.820
<b>Don't worry about it.
Let's start band practice.</b>

03:53.980 --> 03:57.860
<b>I know that just apologizing
isn't enough.</b>

03:58.030 --> 04:01.490
<b>Well, what will be, will be.
That's all I can say.</b>

04:01.830 --> 04:04.290
<b>Heads up!</b>

04:07.460 --> 04:08.870
<b>Ah... sorry.</b>

04:09.250 --> 04:11.330
<b>Are you all right?</b>

04:11.750 --> 04:14.760
<b>I'm at the peak of preparing
pre-order bonuses.</b>

04:15.010 --> 04:16.920
<b>What bonuses?</b>

04:17.050 --> 04:21.090
<b>Yako-sensei's new manga
is coming out next week.</b>

04:21.220 --> 04:22.510
<b>Oh.</b>

04:22.640 --> 04:27.180
<b>At bookstores, you get
three random stickers out of six.</b>

04:27.310 --> 04:31.150
<b>And at that one anime shop,
you get an ultra-cute mini folder.</b>

04:31.270 --> 04:33.150
<b>I drew two versions.</b>

04:33.270 --> 04:35.690
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

04:35.820 --> 04:38.200
<b>Also, at the Akihabara bookstore,</b>

04:38.450 --> 04:43.200
<b>they're showing the illustration
that won the first Magilulu fan contest.</b>

04:43.490 --> 04:45.410
<b>- She's so loud.
- My head hurts...</b>

04:45.540 --> 04:47.620
<b>There, there...</b>

04:47.750 --> 04:48.660
<b>I'm good.</b>

04:51.080 --> 04:56.800
<b>My apology didn't get through, did it?</b>

04:57.260 --> 05:02.720
<b>I get too excited when something
amazes me, so my sincerity doesn't show.</b>

05:02.930 --> 05:04.640
<b>No more apologies.</b>

05:04.760 --> 05:05.930
<b>Yuno-san-chan.</b>

05:06.100 --> 05:08.390
<b>- Cheer up!
- Yes.</b>

05:12.230 --> 05:15.820
<b>Thanks, guys!</b>

05:16.400 --> 05:17.860
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

05:27.450 --> 05:31.920
<b>Miyako-san, Yuno-san-chan,
Nono-chan-san...</b>

05:38.000 --> 05:39.090
<b>All right.</b>

05:42.130 --> 05:43.760
<b>Trends
2. Escape from event</b>

05:48.100 --> 05:49.100
<b>3. Fairy Bouquet</b>

05:49.350 --> 05:50.520
<b>She ruined the event</b>

05:54.150 --> 05:55.480
<b>I knew it.</b>

05:57.820 --> 05:58.940
<b>But...</b>

05:59.780 --> 06:03.990
<b>If I want to move forward,
I need to face the truth.</b>

06:04.740 --> 06:05.910
<b>I have to.</b>

06:06.660 --> 06:07.830
<b>Otherwise,</b>

06:08.620 --> 06:10.830
<b>when Viola makes another move...</b>

06:11.250 --> 06:12.660
<b>Erea hasn't changed</b>

06:11.830 --> 06:13.160
<b>I won't notice.</b>

06:12.790 --> 06:14.120
<b>She always screws things up</b>

06:22.220 --> 06:24.510
<b>I thought it was planned,
but it was real</b>

06:23.300 --> 06:26.430
<b>"Poor Viola."</b>

06:24.680 --> 06:26.430
<b>I'm not a fan, but poor Viola...</b>

06:26.600 --> 06:28.140
<b>Is Erea in high school?</b>

06:27.220 --> 06:28.140
<b>"Erea..."</b>

06:29.010 --> 06:30.890
<b>"A list of Erea's controversies"?</b>

06:31.060 --> 06:32.810
<b>I'm dropping Clematis</b>

06:33.180 --> 06:34.520
<b>Ricchan...</b>

06:41.110 --> 06:42.490
<b>They're fake tears.</b>

06:43.530 --> 06:45.780
<b>It's the same thing she did to me.</b>

06:46.780 --> 06:49.780
<b>I didn't get it back then,
but now I know.</b>

06:50.410 --> 06:52.910
<b>She also messed with Utami-san.</b>

06:54.040 --> 06:55.870
<b>I won't suffer in silence.</b>

06:56.710 --> 06:59.960
<b>I'll never go back
to how I was back then.</b>

07:01.000 --> 07:04.930
<b><i>Magilulu Nice Bulk</i></b>

07:05.050 --> 07:07.640
<b><i>Dreams are power! (When you smile!)</i></b>

07:07.760 --> 07:10.680
<b><i>Dreams are power! (Energy boost!)</i></b>

07:10.810 --> 07:13.390
<b><i>Dreams are power! (Let's live another day!)</i></b>

07:13.520 --> 07:16.020
<b><i>Magical, Physical, Nice Bulk!</i></b>

07:16.140 --> 07:20.320
<b><i>Even when I'm in a desperate situation,
I won't give up</i></b>

07:20.440 --> 07:21.730
<b><i>(Do your best! Do your best! Don't lose!)</i></b>

07:21.860 --> 07:26.070
<b><i>Lift the barbell,
strike a pose, super cute!</i></b>

07:26.200 --> 07:28.070
<b><i>(Nice! Nice! 10/10!)</i></b>

07:26.200 --> 07:28.070
<b>I want to sing.</b>

07:28.200 --> 07:34.080
<b><i>Even when I feel like slouching,
I'll keep my form</i></b>

07:34.200 --> 07:38.330
<b><i>Correct posture, train with heart!</i></b>

07:38.460 --> 07:42.420
<b><i>Body-Make & Pump-Up!!!</i></b>

07:42.550 --> 07:45.380
<b><i>Roar, muscle! Muscle! Physical!</i></b>

07:43.000 --> 07:43.800
<b>Awful</b>

07:43.960 --> 07:44.760
<b>Disgusting</b>

07:45.510 --> 07:48.720
<b><i>Yes! Muscle! Muscle! Magical!</i></b>

07:48.840 --> 07:53.890
<b><i>All your ambitions will turn into power</i></b>

07:51.930 --> 07:53.890
<b>Magilulu Opening and Ending Songs
Complete list</b>

07:54.060 --> 07:56.640
<b><i>That is muscle! Muscle! Physical!</i></b>

08:07.400 --> 08:10.740
<b>M... Magi...</b>

08:10.870 --> 08:13.490
<b>Nice Bulk...</b>

08:14.410 --> 08:16.200
<b>P...Power...</b>

08:16.370 --> 08:18.960
<b>Dreams are... power.</b>

08:19.250 --> 08:20.250
<b>Dreams are...</b>

08:20.420 --> 08:22.130
<b>No good at all.</b>

08:50.450 --> 08:52.780
<b>Finally done.</b>

08:53.740 --> 08:54.780
<b>Complete</b>

08:53.870 --> 08:56.410
<b>I did it.</b>

08:57.000 --> 08:58.330
<b>I did it!</b>

09:06.420 --> 09:07.260
<b>Select file</b>

09:07.380 --> 09:08.010
<b>Uploading</b>

09:14.890 --> 09:17.680
<b>The song's not bad, but the mixing's awful
What a waste</b>

09:15.930 --> 09:17.680
<b>"The song's not bad."</b>

09:22.730 --> 09:24.360
<b>Thank you.</b>

09:25.320 --> 09:28.150
<b>For the next song,
I'll pile on the vocals.</b>

09:29.650 --> 09:31.740
<b>"The thumbnail doesn't pop"?</b>

09:33.700 --> 09:36.120
<b>Maybe I could ask someone.</b>

09:39.790 --> 09:44.080
<b>I hope I can ask Yako-sensei
to draw me one someday.</b>

09:49.340 --> 09:51.970
<b>In-person classes (5-day week)</b>

09:49.630 --> 09:54.180
<b>Should I go out, or stay inside?</b>

09:52.340 --> 09:54.180
<b>Self-study (Online)</b>

09:56.810 --> 09:57.890
<b>I'm scared.</b>

09:59.270 --> 10:00.270
<b>But...</b>

10:02.810 --> 10:04.150
<b>I'm looking for a singer</b>

10:04.270 --> 10:08.400
<b>I can sense strong potential
in your singing</b>

10:05.900 --> 10:08.400
<b>My singing has "potential"?</b>

10:09.400 --> 10:10.780
<b>Back then and now</b>

10:11.320 --> 10:13.660
<b>Poor Viola, she's crying!</b>

10:11.690 --> 10:13.660
<b>are completely different.</b>

10:14.820 --> 10:17.580
<b>I have a new dream to fulfill.</b>

10:21.040 --> 10:24.080
<b>I'll interact with everyone
through my songs.</b>

10:24.210 --> 10:25.250
<b>I...</b>

10:27.960 --> 10:30.170
<b>I will really fight this time!</b>

10:40.520 --> 10:41.720
<b>She's back!</b>

10:41.850 --> 10:43.270
<b>Arale-chan.</b>

10:43.480 --> 10:46.060
<b>- You okay?
- What did the teacher say?</b>

10:46.190 --> 10:50.650
<b>It was just to verify the facts.
I won't be suspended or expelled.</b>

10:50.780 --> 10:54.490
<b>Of course!
You didn't do anything wrong, right?</b>

10:54.610 --> 10:56.240
<b>I did do something...</b>

10:56.360 --> 11:00.540
<b>Posting a minor's face online
is the real crime here.</b>

11:00.660 --> 11:02.410
<b>Can't you sue them?</b>

11:02.540 --> 11:03.910
<b>No...</b>

11:04.250 --> 11:07.290
<b>I think I'll pass on that.</b>

11:07.420 --> 11:10.840
<b>I didn't know you were in a band.</b>

11:10.960 --> 11:11.750
<b>Oh, yeah.</b>

11:11.880 --> 11:15.220
<b>Your collab with Usa-eater-chan
is amazing!</b>

11:15.340 --> 11:17.550
<b>You're way too good at singing!</b>

11:17.720 --> 11:19.140
<b>Let's go to karaoke.</b>

11:19.260 --> 11:20.850
<b>We'll sing Magilulu songs!</b>

11:20.970 --> 11:22.270
<b>I can't today.</b>

11:24.560 --> 11:27.150
<b>I can't let everyone be kind to me.</b>

11:27.270 --> 11:31.610
<b>I still messed up the event
by taking away a member.</b>

11:31.730 --> 11:33.400
<b>What should I do?</b>

11:33.530 --> 11:34.780
<b>Arale-san?</b>

11:35.950 --> 11:37.410
<b>Miyako-san.</b>

11:37.780 --> 11:40.530
<b>Wow, what a coincidence.</b>

11:41.030 --> 11:42.870
<b>Shosan Bookstore</b>

11:44.830 --> 11:46.870
<b>It's the fan art original!</b>

11:47.000 --> 11:48.790
<b>They made a special booth</b>

11:48.920 --> 11:52.090
<b>before the comic release,
and I wanted to see it.</b>

11:52.210 --> 11:54.590
<b>This is amazing! Incredible!</b>

11:54.710 --> 11:57.180
<b>How were you only in elementary school?</b>

11:57.300 --> 12:00.350
<b>The old lady next door
ran a drawing class.</b>

12:00.640 --> 12:03.430
<b>She let me use
her painting tools freely.</b>

12:03.560 --> 12:05.520
<b>Wow, that's why!</b>

12:05.640 --> 12:07.940
<b>It was a lot of trial and error,</b>

12:08.100 --> 12:11.810
<b>Yako Fujimi Exhibition</b>

12:08.480 --> 12:11.810
<b>but I was over the moon
when I received the award.</b>

12:16.240 --> 12:21.160
<b>Becoming a manga artist must've taken
so much effort and struggle.</b>

12:21.700 --> 12:25.790
<b>Even with band practice,
she delivers new work every week.</b>

12:25.910 --> 12:28.120
<b>She's working hard for her fans.</b>

12:28.830 --> 12:33.000
<b>I don't want her to hear all that noise.
How do I make it stop?</b>

12:33.710 --> 12:37.340
<b>How do I make
the online backlash disappear?</b>

12:37.720 --> 12:40.130
<b>Her thoughts are spilling out!</b>

12:40.300 --> 12:42.470
<b>Is it okay for me to listen?</b>

12:42.600 --> 12:44.850
<b>It sounds pretty personal.</b>

12:44.970 --> 12:48.890
<b>I don't really get it,
but I can feel her care and worry.</b>

12:49.190 --> 12:51.900
<b>Your manga series too!
I absolutely love...</b>

13:01.910 --> 13:06.950
<b>She was clearly troubled,
but I couldn't say a single nice thing.</b>

13:07.620 --> 13:10.620
<b>If only they were lines from a story...</b>

13:12.290 --> 13:13.420
<b>Excuse me.</b>

13:17.090 --> 13:20.760
<b>Who's this?
I've never met anyone so beautiful!</b>

13:20.880 --> 13:24.050
<b>Me? Is she really talking to me?!</b>

13:25.430 --> 13:27.350
<b>Uh... well...</b>

13:27.470 --> 13:28.810
<b>Calm down, Miyako!</b>

13:28.930 --> 13:32.310
<b>I knew it!
You're Yako Fujimi-sensei, right?</b>

13:34.230 --> 13:36.440
<b>Miyako!</b>

13:36.820 --> 13:39.030
<b>I've always wanted to meet you.</b>

13:40.740 --> 13:42.280
<b>Oh, I'm sorry.</b>

13:42.410 --> 13:45.950
<b>I heard you talking at the bookstore.</b>

13:46.080 --> 13:50.330
<b>I've seen your face online before.
And this illustration...</b>

13:53.330 --> 13:56.090
<b>That's the first drawing I ever posted.</b>

13:56.210 --> 13:58.090
<b>I immediately fell in love with it.</b>

13:58.590 --> 14:02.090
<b>So I wondered who the artist was,</b>

14:02.220 --> 14:04.180
<b>and I found this article.</b>

14:04.340 --> 14:05.930
<b>Certificate
Yako Fujimi</b>

14:06.510 --> 14:09.100
<b>It's such a small picture...</b>

14:11.020 --> 14:14.600
<b>I'm sorry for taking up your time.</b>

14:15.150 --> 14:18.900
<b>I'm really happy I got to talk with you.</b>

14:21.940 --> 14:24.110
<b>It's my pleasure.</b>

14:24.410 --> 14:27.160
<b>Why am I being friendly with everyone</b>

14:27.280 --> 14:30.200
<b>and acting like life's a breeze?</b>

14:40.760 --> 14:42.510
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

14:51.310 --> 14:54.850
<b>First, I have an announcement
regarding Nakamachi-san.</b>

14:54.980 --> 14:57.060
<b>- I'm getting fired?!
- No.</b>

14:57.230 --> 14:58.730
<b>Please, no more trouble...</b>

14:58.860 --> 15:01.650
<b>A bit of a conclusion,
for better or worse.</b>

15:02.110 --> 15:05.240
<b>A girl named Ritsu Minetsuki
will be joining MewType.</b>

15:09.080 --> 15:10.540
<b>You didn't know?</b>

15:11.080 --> 15:13.870
<b>Looks like Minetsuki-san
values confidentiality.</b>

15:14.000 --> 15:16.250
<b>So the other group admitted fault?</b>

15:16.370 --> 15:19.210
<b>Well, we did get an apology.</b>

15:20.040 --> 15:23.210
<b>But when a member leaves,
people start talking.</b>

15:21.130 --> 15:22.920
<b>It was Viola's doing...</b>

15:23.760 --> 15:26.260
<b>They speculate on what must've happened.</b>

15:27.050 --> 15:32.180
<b>So they made it look like we poached her
just to cover their own risk.</b>

15:32.430 --> 15:36.480
<b>I'm ready to take this on,
so please accept her as well.</b>

15:36.600 --> 15:37.810
<b>Okay.</b>

15:37.940 --> 15:40.310
<b>She will be on guitar too, Miyanaga-san.</b>

15:40.440 --> 15:42.780
<b>Leave it to me!</b>

15:42.900 --> 15:44.740
<b>It'll blow up even more.</b>

15:47.910 --> 15:50.700
<b>Now, the next page is about security.</b>

15:51.200 --> 15:52.660
<b>This will be on the test.</b>

15:53.080 --> 15:56.080
<b>"Congratulations on the release
of your first volume."</b>

15:56.210 --> 15:57.960
<b>"It's off to a good start,"</b>

15:58.080 --> 16:01.920
<b>"and we've received
various inquiries from bookstores."</b>

16:04.550 --> 16:07.760
<b>To all my fans, thank you so much!</b>

16:07.880 --> 16:11.600
<b>I'm truly overwhelmed with joy
that you're enjoying it!</b>

16:11.760 --> 16:14.220
<b>I can't wait to head to the bookstore.</b>

16:14.350 --> 16:18.640
<b>I want to see
how everyone is reacting.</b>

16:22.820 --> 16:24.150
<b>Shosan Bookstore</b>

16:22.900 --> 16:24.150
<b>Welcome.</b>

16:26.240 --> 16:28.740
<b>Here, look! It just got released today.</b>

16:28.860 --> 16:30.620
<b>Oh, the art's really cute.</b>

16:30.870 --> 16:33.330
<b>The art's great, but the story too...</b>

16:33.450 --> 16:34.790
<b>I'll lend it to you.</b>

16:35.410 --> 16:36.580
<b>You're here?</b>

16:39.330 --> 16:41.130
<b>It's you again.</b>

16:42.130 --> 16:44.630
<b>What a coincidence to meet you here.</b>

16:47.760 --> 16:52.050
<b>If this meeting is fate,
I hope it continues.</b>

16:52.890 --> 16:54.720
<b>That line...</b>

16:55.890 --> 17:00.230
<b>I won't let it end in an instant,
like fireworks.</b>

17:03.770 --> 17:06.690
<b>I love this line.</b>

17:07.280 --> 17:11.200
<b>I'm surprised you know it.
That was just a standalone story.</b>

17:11.320 --> 17:14.950
<b>It was before the series,
so I didn't expect to read it,</b>

17:15.330 --> 17:17.620
<b>Chupacabu Saturation
Yako Fujimi</b>

17:15.490 --> 17:17.620
<b>but it was included.</b>

17:20.000 --> 17:24.170
<b>You despise people who shine.</b>

17:25.340 --> 17:27.170
<b>I never had it to begin with.</b>

17:27.760 --> 17:32.430
<b>No matter how hard I try,
I'll never have that shining radiance.</b>

17:32.800 --> 17:34.260
<b>It's frustrating.</b>

17:34.600 --> 17:37.220
<b>But I can't look away.</b>

17:37.720 --> 17:39.520
<b>Even if I close my eyes,</b>

17:39.640 --> 17:44.230
<b>the radiance intrudes without mercy,
and it's agonizing.</b>

17:44.940 --> 17:50.780
<b>But it feels like your story
is telling me that it's okay.</b>

17:50.900 --> 17:52.150
<b>This girl</b>

17:53.200 --> 17:57.660
<b>sees me through my work.</b>

18:04.710 --> 18:06.670
<b>- I'm sorry.
- Let them stay.</b>

18:07.800 --> 18:11.300
<b>They're sparkling. It's beautiful.</b>

18:14.340 --> 18:16.430
<b>Seasonal Strawberry Parfait</b>

18:18.890 --> 18:19.890
<b>It's delicious.</b>

18:20.390 --> 18:24.400
<b>I didn't know there was such
a lovely place near the school.</b>

18:24.520 --> 18:25.610
<b>I'm glad.</b>

18:25.730 --> 18:30.190
<b>I come here when
I'm feeling sad or troubled.</b>

18:30.860 --> 18:32.280
<b>Troubled...</b>

18:32.650 --> 18:34.450
<b>What's wrong?</b>

18:36.240 --> 18:37.830
<b>It's nothing.</b>

18:38.330 --> 18:40.240
<b>The sparkle is dazzling.</b>

18:42.410 --> 18:45.580
<b>The sugar pearls are sparkling,</b>

18:46.250 --> 18:48.130
<b>just like you, Yako-sensei.</b>

18:49.750 --> 18:53.630
<b>That means you hate it, right?</b>

18:53.760 --> 18:55.760
<b>I hate what I can't have.</b>

18:56.590 --> 18:57.800
<b>But...</b>

18:59.930 --> 19:03.980
<b>If I can own it, I love it.</b>

19:05.190 --> 19:07.770
<b>I love things that sparkle.</b>

19:09.020 --> 19:12.280
<b>Melt me with your shine,</b>

19:13.820 --> 19:15.400
<b>and keep shining.</b>

19:16.610 --> 19:18.450
<b>Shine?</b>

19:22.450 --> 19:23.620
<b>How?</b>

19:24.330 --> 19:27.250
<b>I want to see your live show.</b>

19:27.500 --> 19:29.710
<b>I'm sure you can shine.</b>

19:29.840 --> 19:30.670
<b>A live show...</b>

19:30.800 --> 19:35.340
<b>There are things you only realize
once you actually try them.</b>

19:36.470 --> 19:37.930
<b>Please do it.</b>

19:38.760 --> 19:40.050
<b>This is Ritsu Minetsuki-san.</b>

19:40.510 --> 19:42.470
<b>Her avatar's still being made.</b>

19:42.600 --> 19:44.890
<b>I'm Ritsu Minetsuki. I'm sorry for...</b>

19:45.020 --> 19:47.270
<b>I'm tired of hearing that.</b>

19:47.400 --> 19:50.230
<b>As I said before,
you did what you wanted.</b>

19:50.520 --> 19:52.190
<b>And that's fine.</b>

19:53.440 --> 19:54.650
<b>Thank you.</b>

19:54.820 --> 19:57.570
<b>You two know each other?</b>

19:57.700 --> 19:59.620
<b>- A little.
- Since when?</b>

19:59.740 --> 20:04.700
<b>Well, she gave me some meat
when I was about to break.</b>

20:04.830 --> 20:06.500
<b>Were you hungry?</b>

20:06.620 --> 20:07.960
<b>That's misleading.</b>

20:08.620 --> 20:10.250
<b>Thank you.</b>

20:10.630 --> 20:13.960
<b>I wanted to thank you,
but it ended up like this.</b>

20:14.300 --> 20:18.300
<b>I'm deeply grateful for your help,
and everyone's acceptance.</b>

20:18.430 --> 20:21.350
<b>I'm determined to repay that kindness.</b>

20:21.470 --> 20:23.470
<b>I'll do my best. Thank you.</b>

20:24.220 --> 20:25.720
<b>The pleasure's ours.</b>

20:28.350 --> 20:30.440
<b>You should all get ready.</b>

20:30.600 --> 20:33.110
<b>I don't mind what's said about me,</b>

20:33.230 --> 20:36.650
<b>but this announcement
could be bad for MewType...</b>

20:38.900 --> 20:41.240
<b>I'll do anything to fix it!</b>

20:42.740 --> 20:44.160
<b>How about a live show?</b>

20:44.330 --> 20:45.080
<b>A live show?</b>

20:45.240 --> 20:48.040
<b>I think we just need
to show our brilliance.</b>

20:48.160 --> 20:50.830
<b>There are things
we won't know unless we try.</b>

20:50.960 --> 20:53.000
<b>That's it!</b>

20:53.130 --> 20:56.090
<b>If Ricchan can show
she's good with MewType,</b>

20:56.210 --> 20:59.010
<b>maybe everyone will get why she joined.</b>

20:59.130 --> 21:02.470
<b>You said before
that you wanted to perform live.</b>

21:02.600 --> 21:06.390
<b>I want to, but now's not the time.
It'd make things worse.</b>

21:06.640 --> 21:09.100
<b>A live show could change everything.</b>

21:09.230 --> 21:11.270
<b>You're well aware of it too.</b>

21:11.400 --> 21:14.020
<b>You gave me a chance
to leave the darkness,</b>

21:14.480 --> 21:16.570
<b>and now my world has changed.</b>

21:16.690 --> 21:19.150
<b>This situation is different.</b>

21:19.320 --> 21:20.650
<b>It's still the worst.</b>

21:20.780 --> 21:23.700
<b>We might mess up,
but a crisis is a chance,</b>

21:23.820 --> 21:26.330
<b>and if we try hard, things can change.</b>

21:26.450 --> 21:29.960
<b>If they watch the show,
they'll see how close you are,</b>

21:30.080 --> 21:33.750
<b>and even those who say nasty things
might understand.</b>

21:34.080 --> 21:36.460
<b>It's too soon. I'm against it.</b>

21:36.630 --> 21:37.920
<b>Yuno-san-chan.</b>

21:38.050 --> 21:41.930
<b>How we put out information
is more difficult than you think.</b>

21:42.380 --> 21:44.760
<b>This isn't just about Minetsuki-san.</b>

21:44.890 --> 21:47.100
<b>It affects everyone's future.</b>

21:47.220 --> 21:51.480
<b>We need to think of the best way
to do this for MewType's sake.</b>

21:55.980 --> 22:03.700
<b><i>Why can birds fly through the sky?
Why are cats always asleep?</i></b>

22:03.820 --> 22:07.620
<b><i>How will you live today?</i></b>

22:07.740 --> 22:15.500
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

22:19.510 --> 22:27.260
<b><i>Why does the morning sun kiss my skin?
Why does the night leave me feeling down?</i></b>

22:27.390 --> 22:35.350
<b><i>If only we could split our sorrows in half
Wouldn't that be great?</i></b>

22:35.480 --> 22:43.610
<b><i>Laughter and worry interweave
In a corner of this vast world</i></b>

22:43.740 --> 22:52.410
<b><i>Come with us
To uncover the wonders of the universe</i></b>

22:53.000 --> 23:00.800
<b><i>What stories shall we share today?
What melodies shall we sing?</i></b>

23:00.920 --> 23:04.630
<b><i>Even flowers as yet unseen</i></b>

23:04.760 --> 23:11.970
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:12.680 --> 23:20.150
<b><i>All, all, all of it
Let's go search for it all</i></b>

23:25.490 --> 23:28.660
<b>Girls aiming for the summit
of a sheer cliff.</b>

23:28.820 --> 23:31.330
<b>- Miyako-san!
- No, don't worry about me!</b>

23:31.540 --> 23:32.290
<b>No!</b>

23:32.490 --> 23:34.870
<b>- Here, take my hand!
- Yes!</b>

23:36.670 --> 23:39.880
<b>- Let's go!
- Their battle has only just begun!</b>

23:37.250 --> 23:39.920
<b>Turning over a new leaf</b>
